<title>USA: ZMAX acquires Century Services.</title>
<headline>ZMAX acquires Century Services.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ZMAX Corp said Thursday it plans to acquire Century Services Inc, a software developer that has designed a system for correcting computer code dates that terminate in the year 2000.</p>
<p>Its VISION 2000 system includes diagnostic and remedial tools, as well as management and technical support, ZMAX said.</p>
<p>ZMAX has agreed to provide Century Services with immediate funding of $1.0 million for working capital and has committed an additional $4.0 million to support its growth.</p>
<p>The deal is set to close on Oct. 15.</p>
</text>
